## Troubleshooting problems with 1Password commit signing

Use this guidance if you cannot sign commits using 1Password and SSH.

### Before you start

If commit signing was previously working, restart your laptop and try again.

### Check the 1Password SSH agent

Check that the 1Password SSH agent is running:

1. Open 1Password.
2. Go to **Settings**.
3. ???

### Check your environment variables

Run the following to make sure your environment variables are set correctly:

```shell
echo $SSH_AUTH_SOCK
echo $GPG_TTY
```
